<title>USA: Barnard FD, N.Y., won by Fleet Securities.</title>
<headline>Barnard FD, N.Y., won by Fleet Securities.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-02-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Fleet Securities Inc. said it won $2.200 million of Barnard Fire Dist in the Town of Greece, N.Y., fire district bonds, 1997, with a net interest cost of 5.42 percent.</p>
</text>
